# Family 2 Redesign Contract

## 1. Executive summary

Family 2 currently consists of two authenticated customer surfaces:

- `/reservation/new`: one-page booking form.
- `/my/reservations`: one-page reservation list with filters, pagination, and cancellation.

The backend supports authenticated booking, service selection, date/time availability, reservation listing, and conditional cancellation. It does not support guest booking, staff selection, reservation detail retrieval, rescheduling, customer edits, rebooking, pricing, policies, or booking holds.

The redesign should become a focused, authenticated booking task flow and an operational “我的預約” workspace. It must retain the existing routes and contracts until backend decisions justify expansion.

