## 46. Recommended implementation phases

1. Route/domain/timezone foundation and customer-role boundary.
2. Booking context, service/date/time selection, loading/error/no-availability states.
3. Booking review, submit lock, conflict recovery, and result state.
4. Reservation workspace: next/upcoming/history, status and list states.
